{
  "requirement": "The SDK offers this `Sources` method. Its source tools expose the\n`list_sources` command within the project directory.\n\n```rust,ignore\nimpl Sources {\n    // ...\n\n    /// List file identities within this scope.\n    pub async fn list(&self, scope: &SourceScope) -> Result<Vec<PathBuf>, SourceError>;\n\n    // ...\n}\n```",
